OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fshowers around in the north this
OL,7,Fevening. Gradually turning cloudier
OL,8,Fovernight with outbreaks of rain which
OL,9,Fwill become more persistent, and
OL,10,Fpossibly heavy by dawn.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA wet morning with plenty
OL,13,Fof cloud around to start, though
OL,14,Fbrightening for the afternoon with a
OL,15,Ffew light showers possible further
OL,16,Fwest. Feeling cooler with a
OL,17,Fnorthwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
