OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FOn
OL,6,FThursday a dry, sunny, but chilly
OL,7,Fstart, before cloud and rain moves in
OL,8,Fovernight. Feeling milder Friday, with
OL,9,Frain clearing to showers behind,
OL,10,Fcontinuing into Saturday with sunny
OL,11,Fintervals.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
